Article 21-3 (Entrustment of business) The Minister of the Interior and Safety and the head of a local government shall entrust the following business to the Korea Local Information Research and Development Institute under Article 72 of the Electronic Government Act, pursuant to Article 36-5 of the Act:
  1. Operation of the integrated local government subsidy management network;
  2. Processing of data or information under the subparagraphs of Article 28-4(1) of the Act;
  3. Operation of the online service system under Article 36-4 of the Act.
